+  // ===========================================================================================================
+  // Optimized decode (stages EPI / BAL, KT_DS41_MU_K2EPLUS): same arithmetic per output row as the legacy forward_decode
+  // with KERN 1/2 (same kernels via gemm_mxfp4 on row views, same bf16 roundings, same act_fn, same Q8/permutation
+  // per 32-group, same FMA chain over j in the weighted sum); only the work split changes:
+  //   * input prepared once (from_mat on one BufferA),
+  //   * gate/up task = the SAME rows of gate and up; SwiGLU + down-activation (Q8 or permuted fp32) of every finished
+  //     32-group in the epilogue (no serial SwiGLU, no pack job),
+  //   * EPI only: 36 tasks/expert (32 rows each), legacy down split (80/expert) and serial weighted sum,
+  //   * BAL: equal-size row ranges over all experts (partial 32-groups completed by the last thread via a counter);
